.SH NAME
anpu-update - Update ANPU to the latest release


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBanpu update [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Check the latest ANPU release on GitHub, download the matching
asset for this OS/architecture, verify its SHA-256 checksum (and the
cosign signature when cosign is installed), and replace the running
binary atomically. Network access is limited to github.com.

.PP
Use --check to only report whether an update is available.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--check\fP[=false]
	only check for an update; do not download or replace

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for update


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to a YAML config file (default: anpu.yaml in the current directory, if present)

.PP
\fB--data-dir\fP=""
	data directory for the scan-history DB and caches (default: os.UserConfigDir()/anpu; override with the ANPU_HOME environment variable)

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	show per-stage finding and warning counts


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBanpu(1)\fP


